        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Histological confirmation of amyloid deposits plus identification of pathogenic B2M gene variant",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential to differentiate variant ABeta2M amyloidosis from dialysis-related amyloidosis."
